you're like a dream.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.960
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.850
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.690
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.490
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:41.290
Whenever I start something new

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:45.000
I get really excited,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.670
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.810
