Which anime's up first on Shugo Chara Party?

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.430
The one starring the Guardian Characters:

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.430
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:55.850
I wonder what Ran, Miki, and Su will be up to today?

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:56.570
Check it out!

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.220
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:07.410
"Hide and Go Seek."

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:09.230
Hide and go seek!

